  "new_package_handling": "New packages scaffolded with `beep create-package` or `beep architecture` already wire `beep:check:tests` into `beep:check`; keep new packages out of this baseline rather than regenerating it.",
  "notes": {
    "@beep/repo-cli": "Deferred deliberately: the CLI owns the repo's largest test surface. Its test/tsconfig.json narrows include to ./**/*.test.ts, which leaves test/global-cleanup.ts and test/support/CommandTest.ts unselected, so no project it owns covers the whole test tree. Remediate as its own packet.",
    "@beep/infra": "Test project lives at test/tsconfig.json (not tsconfig.test.json) and check runs only tsgo -b tsconfig.json; its ./**/*.test.ts include also leaves infra/test/schemaParity.ts unselected."
